          },
          "author": "Andy Stanton",
          "description": "The fifth fabulously funny Mr Gum story by Andy Stanton, read by the author and with music and sound effects. A fantastic book for boys and girls aged 7-10 years old\n\nGood evening. Do you like bears called Padlock? Course you do. Do you like hot-air balloons? Course you do. Do you like tall sailing ships with mad sea captains, and horrifying old villains and words like ‘wab!’, ‘tungler’ and ‘kelp’? COURSE you do!\n\nWell, guess what, you lucky little nibbleheads? This book’s got all of those things – and a lot more besides. It’s a rollicker! It’s a frolicker! It’s a fun-time sun-time yollicker! So what you waiting for? GET LISTENING!",
          "audioPreviewUrl": "https://audio-previews-media.api.yotoplay.com/audio-previews/6cf89344938084f1b92219093d02902dd188ec2aaf672f74a5a482d7c8844d80/4v0x3MkDnxJozQEKL1mRPMkF51ZDhhoqTE0k3yOAV-o.mp3",
